{{!-- What `cargo about` writes for `cargo xtask notices`: no page, but each
licence text it found once, with the crates that are under it, a field to a
line. The tooling reads this (`records` in `xtask/src/notices.rs`), puts it
in order and writes THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md from it, so nothing here is laid
out for anybody to read. Three braces, since two would write a text as a web
page spells it. --}}
{{#each licenses}}
%%licence%% {{{id}}}
%%name%% {{{name}}}
%%from%% {{#if source_path}}file{{else}}standard{{/if}}
{{#each used_by}}
%%library%% {{{crate.name}}} {{{crate.version}}}
%%where%% {{{crate.repository}}}
%%manifest%% {{{crate.manifest_path}}}
{{#each crate.authors}}
%%by%% {{{this}}}
{{/each}}
{{/each}}
%%text%%
{{{text}}}
%%end%%
{{/each}}
